# Documentation

Canonical source: `documentation/` (`index.md` hub). GitHub Pages build reads `docs/` - update manifests via `scripts/docs/materialize-docs-for-pages.sh` when moving files.

## Zero to Hero (three docs - do not conflate)

| File | Scope |
|------|-------|
| `getting-started/ZERO_TO_HERO.md` | First-lab quick start |
| `learning-path/SUPPLY_CHAIN_ATTACKS_ZERO_TO_HERO.md` | Full curriculum |
| `scenario-guides/zero-to-hero/ZERO_TO_HERO_SCENARIO_NN.md` | Per-scenario walkthrough |

Quick refs: `scenario-guides/quick-reference/QUICK_REFERENCE_SCENARIO_NN.md`. Floci track (all 25 labs; deeper on several): `guides/FLOCI_INTEGRATION.md`.

Command Center learner path: `getting-started/COMMAND_CENTER.md`. UI / lesson / campaign maintainer note: `platform/DASHBOARD.md`. Tabletop facilitator: `guides/tabletop-quiet-carrier.md`.

Zero-to-hero and quick-ref trees are in `.cursorignore` for code-focused indexing - open the target file directly when editing guides.

Markdown prose uses ASCII hyphen `-` and straight quotes. No em dash, en dash, curly quotes, or zero-width marks. CI: `node scripts/docs/check-markdown-watermarks.js`. Injectors (`mitigation-playbooks.js`, `generate-observability-section.js`) must emit ASCII too. SVG diagram labels may still use em dashes (`diagram-specs.js`).

## After content or mitigation changes

1. `scripts/lib/mitigation-playbooks.js` - canonical bullets (if mitigations changed)
2. `node scripts/docs/sync-mitigation-gaps.js` - DETECT `## Mitigation` + README playbooks (01-06)
3. `node scripts/docs/inject-zero-to-hero-mitigation-playbooks.js` - zero-to-hero playbooks
4. `node scripts/docs/inject-markdown-toc.js all` - rebuild TOCs
5. Observability blocks: `detection-tools/es/scenario-diagram-steps.js` then `generate-observability-section.js` (End-to-end flow iframes the Archify architecture HTML; Phase 1-5 iframes the Archify sequence HTML)
6. `node detection-tools/es/load-runbooks.js` - if `DETECT.md` structure changed
7. **Add/remove a scenario:** update README / AUTHORS / Pages hero + `docs-manifest` / CATALOG / zero-to-hero + quick-ref + modules indexes / observability N and 2N counts / playbooks / control-plane registry / `lesson.yaml` - then `node scripts/docs/check-info-consistency.js` and `node scripts/docs/check-lesson-yaml.js` (CI-enforced)
8. **Hand-authored diagrams:** specs in `scripts/lib/diagram-specs.js` (nodes/edges/labels/drawing rules). Assets under `documentation/assets/diagrams/` as `.excalidraw` + `.svg` pairs. Platform and codeflow Markdown embeds SVG only. Observability End-to-end flow embeds the Archify architecture HTML, Phase 1-5 embeds the Archify sequence HTML, and Code-level workflow embeds the Archify workflow HTML. Leave the viewer toolbar on; do not add `?embed=1`. Escape `&` as `&amp;` in SVG. After edits: `node scripts/diagrams/check-diagram-assets.js` (CI-enforced)
9. After Markdown edits: `node scripts/docs/check-markdown-watermarks.js` (CI-enforced in smoke.yml)
10. Lesson / campaign / classroom copy: keep ASCII; validate lessons with `node scripts/docs/check-lesson-yaml.js`

Full script catalog: `platform/TOOLING.md`.
